  "reasoning": "The defendants, a company and its legal representative, used a government official’s position to fraudulently obtain a recommendation letter that allowed a company without proper qualifications to engage in oil extraction. They intended to share the illegal profits and paid a 200,000 yuan bribe to the official. This conduct constitutes the crime of bribery (unit bribery) for giving the illegal payment, and the crime of illegal mining (unauthorized extraction of mineral resources) for facilitating the unlawful oil extraction operation.",
